    "mechanismDiff": "E/attack/cons only rename AdditionalTag types; burst.go also changes frame default. Q is not implemented by this module."
  },
  "mechanics": {
    "C1": "cons.go:c1: cannon additional tag plus elemental-skill attack tag adds CD=1; no loop-shot bonus.",
    "A4": "asc.go:a4Amount: consume 0–2 explicitly active stacks; FlatDmg=3.2*stacks*TotalAtk at cannon action creation, before release snapshot.",
    "nightsoul": "skill.go:Skill: cannon requires active blessing and exactly MaxPoints (20); points drain before snapshot. E entry itself does not deal damage.",
    "loopPair": "attack.go:skillAttack: two E-tag dendro hits at 30/38f or 31/38f; common-panel sum requires both contacts and stable state.",
    "A1": "asc.go:a1: marked target taking burning/burgeon damage generates 7 points under 0.8s ICD; it does not directly multiply cannon damage."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Only C0/C1 selected E damage; C2+ and Q remain uncovered.",
    "No nightsoul, burning, target desolation, A4 expiry, energy or rotation simulation.",
    "Pinned a4Amount reads a tag without checking status expiry; input must describe actual unexpired stacks rather than replay this upstream lifecycle omission.",
    "No default nightsoul-active, full points or A4 stacks inferred from public showcase."
  ]
